:1107,"text":"You overhear a conversation: \"I can't believe that Wailsrond has fallen!\" A merchant exclaims. \"Aye!\" Another one adds. \"I fear trade will suffer very much, and we will live through hard economic times.\"","authored":false,"provenance":{"sourceFile":"Data SD2","recordIndex":1107,"byteOffset":283392,"byteLength":256,"confidence":"source-backed"}},{"id":1108,"text":"You overhear a conversation: \"Did you hear? Wailsrond has fallen!\" A woman exclaims. \"Aye!\" Another one adds. \"I fear that Sharranth cannot be stopped, and soon the Warlord will attack us as well!\"","authored":false,"provenance":{"sourceFile":"Data SD2","recordIndex":1108,"byteOffset":283648,"byteLength":256,"confidence":"source-backed"}},{"id":1109,"text":"You overhear a conversation: \"Me cain't believe that Wailsrond has fallen!\" A sailor exclaims. \"Oy!\" A miner adds. \"An' ye cain be sure that Sharranth will come fer us next! These be dark times acomin', friend, even darker than six moons past.\"","authored":false,"provenance":{"sourceFile":"Data SD2","recordIndex":1109,"byteOffset":283904,"byteLength":256,"confidence":"source-backed"}},{"id":1110,"text":"\"Were are the Heroes of the Sword Lands? Why aren't they doing anything to stop this?\"","authored":false,"provenance":{"sourceFile":"Data SD2","recordIndex":1110,"byteOffset":284160,"byteLength":256,"confidence":"source-backed"}},{"id":1246,"text":"\"Bah!\" Someone else replies. \"Don't count on them! I heard that they got a better offer from the Warlord of Sharranth, and took it!\" A woman shakes her head, sadly: \"Then we may be doomed ...\"","authored":false,"provenance":{"sourceFile":"Data SD2","recordIndex":1246,"byteOffset":318976,"byteLength":256,"confidence":"source-backed"}}],"randomLevels":[],"optionLabels":[]}
